WHY SHARE-ALIKE
---------------
The tracker bundles nickname theme data from Behind the Name
(https://www.behindthename.com), which is published under CC BY-SA 4.0. That
licence is share-alike and the data is baked into the single HTML file, so the
whole work carries the same terms. See CREDITS.md.

NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE
---------------------------
  * Pokémon portraits from the PMD Sprite Collab project, which the tracker
    requests at runtime and does not redistribute. Those remain the work of
    their individual spriters.
  * Pokémon Decay's artwork, which belongs to that game's developers and is
    deliberately absent from this repository.
  * Pokémon itself, which is © Nintendo / Creatures Inc. / GAME FREAK. This
    project is unofficial and unaffiliated.
